{title: 220 - When He Comes}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Jesus Christ}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Eb]When He comes, When He comes,
[Bb7]We shall [Cm]see [Bb7/Ab]the [Eb/G]Lord in [Ab]glory
[Cm]when He comes! [Bb7]As I [Eb]read the gospel story,
[Cm]We shall [Fm]see the Lord in glory,
[Fm]We shall see [Bb]the Lord in glory [Fm]when [Bb7]He comes!
[Eb/Bb]With the [Ab]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Cm]With the [Fm]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Bb7]As I [Eb]read the gospel story,
[Cm]We shall [Fm]see the Lord in glory,
[Fm]With the [Bb]alleluias ringing [Fm]to the sky!

Verse 2:
[Eb]When He comes, When He comes,
[Bb7]We shall [Cm]hear [Bb7/Ab]the [Eb/G]trumpet [Ab]sounded,
[Cm]when He comes! [Bb7]We shall [Eb]hear the trumpet sounded,
[Cm]See the [Fm]Lord by saints surrounded,
[Fm]We shall hear [Bb]the trumpet sounded, [Fm]when [Bb7]He comes!
[Eb/Bb]With the [Ab]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Cm]With the [Fm]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Bb7]We shall [Eb]hear the trumpet sounded,
[Cm]See the [Fm]Lord by saints surrounded,
[Fm]With the [Bb]alleluias ringing [Fm]to the sky!

Verse 3:
[Eb]When He comes, When He comes,
[Bb7]We shall [Cm]all [Bb7/Ab]rise [Eb/G]up to [Ab]meet [Eb]Him
[Cm]when He comes! [Bb7]We shall [Eb]all rise up to meet Him,
[Cm]When He [Fm]calls His own to greet Him
[Fm]We shall all [Bb]rise up to meet [Fm]Him when [Bb7]He comes!
[Eb/Bb]With the [Ab]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Cm]With the [Fm]alleluias ringing to the sky,
[Bb7]We shall [Eb]all rise up to meet Him,
[Cm]When He [Fm]calls His own to greet Him,
[Fm]With the [Bb]alleluias ringing [Fm]to the sky!
